Dancing with the locals was so much fun!

546
00:31:38,969 --> 00:31:42,253
That must have become a wonderful memory.

547
00:31:42,276 --> 00:31:45,610
What is the UK famous for?

548
00:31:45,633 --> 00:31:50,300
The clock tower called Big Ben is iconic.

549
00:31:50,323 --> 00:31:53,770
And we drink a lot of tea every day, too!

550
00:31:53,794 --> 00:31:57,892
I'd love to try authentic British tea someday.

551
00:31:57,915 --> 00:32:01,717
What do you want to do in Japan in the future?

552
00:32:01,740 --> 00:32:07,107
I want to publish a book introducing Japanese culture to the UK.

553
00:32:07,130 --> 00:32:11,201
I’d like to keep researching more.

554
00:32:11,225 --> 00:32:14,682
I’m really looking forward to your book!

555
00:32:14,705 --> 00:32:16,923
Thank you so much.

556
00:32:16,946 --> 00:32:19,985
Thank you so much.